flowchart TD
    ACQ["<b>1. Data Acquisition</b><br/>DataBento MBP-10<br/>6 symbols × 4 days<br/>~7M tick events / symbol"]
    RES["<b>2. Offline Feature Research</b><br/>IC / ICIR scoring per feature<br/>Greedy conditional IC selection<br/>Outputs selected_features.yaml"]
    PREP["<b>3. Data Preparation</b><br/>FeaturePipeline.fit on train only<br/>Welford online z-score normalisation<br/>18 memmap files (6 symbols × 3 days)<br/>val + test DataFrames"]
    GRD["<b>4. Config Guardrails</b><br/>50 pre-flight checks<br/>FATAL → ValueError / abort<br/>WARN → prompt or auto-proceed"]
    TRAIN["<b>5. RL Training</b><br/>Algorithms: TD3 · DDPG · PPO · Random<br/>StreamingTradingEnvXY episode shuffle<br/>DSR or log-return reward<br/>Runtime health monitor (early stop)<br/>Checkpoints + MLflow logging"]
    EVAL["<b>6. Post-Training Evaluation</b><br/>Deterministic rollout on val + test<br/>Sharpe · Sortino · drawdown metrics<br/>Buy-and-hold / TWAP / VWAP benchmarks<br/>Statistical significance tests<br/>Permutation + IG explainability"]

    ACQ --> RES
    RES -.->|"optional: reduced<br/>feature config"| PREP
    ACQ --> PREP
    PREP --> GRD
    GRD -->|"pass"| TRAIN
    TRAIN --> EVAL

    style ACQ  fill:#bfdbfe,stroke:#3b82f6
    style RES  fill:#fef08a,stroke:#ca8a04
